ied  by the united states to fight the  taliban are now being used by some  militias against civilians to commit  human rights violations  the defense department is calculating  just how much money the white house will  need from congress for weapons for  ukraine whatever the amount president  biden says the goal is to keep the  weapons flowing without interruption  kimberly helkin al jazeera the white  house
 

